  "row_count": 21,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 6.918 + 3.026 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.382 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$$\n\\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 6. 9 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 1. 5 1 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 0. 3 8 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 0 6 9\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-1633 K: $\\Delta Hr^0 = 57.865 - 3.312 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} + 0.406 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^2 - 80.250 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$$\n\\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 5 7. 8 6 5 + 3. 3 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 0. 4 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 4 0. 1 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4 2. 6 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}\n$$\n1633-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 54.617 - 1.063 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.065 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 125.850 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$$\n\\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 5 4. 6 1 7 + 1. 0 6 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 0 6 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 6 2. 9 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 4. 8 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}\n$$\nSource: Data from Gronvold (47) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 6.918 + 3.026 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.382 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$$",
      "\\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 6. 9 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 1. 5 1 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 0. 3 8 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2. 0 6 9",
      "$$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-1633 K: $\\Delta Hr^0 = 57.865 - 3.312 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} + 0.406 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^2 - 80.250 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$$",
      "\\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 5 7. 8 6 5 + 3. 3 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 0. 4 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 4 0. 1 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 4 2. 6 8 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}",
      "$$",
      "1633-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 54.617 - 1.063 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.065 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 125.850 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$$",
      "\\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = 5 4. 6 1 7 + 1. 0 6 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 0 6 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} - 6 2. 9 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 2 4. 8 1 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T}",
      "$$",
      "Source: Data from Gronvold (47) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K."
